+  licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0,
+  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Distributed unmodified as
+  crates/ckks-train-bench/data/breast_cancer.csv (UCI's wdbc.data, renamed); source URL and
